Date: Tue, 19 Aug 2025 21:20:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [AArch64] Remove wrong processor feature (#151289)

`fmov dX, dY` is not a preferred instruction.

Previously introduced by:
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/144152

patch.cherry: true
patch.metadata.author: Tomer Shafir <tomer.shafir8@gmail.com>
patch.metadata.original_sha: ffddf33beb8097e760fafcbdd28d56c1d055e820
patch.platforms: chromiumos
patch.version_range.from: 580390
